  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1338/440/javaw_ocp2f9cnbu-copy.png\" alt=\"bg\" width=\"539\" height=\"539\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">本模组将温顺的巨兽——海牛（也称海牛）添加到了游戏中。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以在河流或海滩附近找到它们的身影。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">它们游动缓慢，但受惊时会加速前进。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以用海草和 kelp 来引诱它们。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如果它们长时间（5-10分钟）待在水里，</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">背上就会长出不同类型的藻类，直到你帮它们清理干净。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">你可以用海绵或刷子将它们刷掉。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">在清理过程中，它们还会掉落一个在浅水游荡时黏在背上的物品。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">使用海绵清理时，海绵不会被消耗。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">在 Forge 中，你可以在 data -> biome tags 和 biome modifier 文件夹中编辑 json 文件或通过资源包更改此项及其他生成设置。而在 Fabric 中，则有单独的配置文件。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">在 data -> tags -> item 文件夹中还提供了 json 物品标签文件。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">因此你可以更改清洁物品、常见、稀有、罕见掉落物以及海牛的食物/引诱物品。</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">模组目前支持</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Forge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1 | 1.19.4 | 1.19.2 | 1.18.2</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Fabric 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>Neoforge 26.x | 1.21.11 |1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1458/184/638946510197549497.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">鸣谢：</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">FAU 海港分支海洋研究所 - 海牛的声音</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">汤姆·希德勒斯顿，地球之声</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>如果你需要该模组的其他版本，或在 CurseForge 平台上遇到任何错误，请私信我。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>在 X（推特）上关注我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>本模组需要安装 AquariusLibs</strong></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
